                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "Ld1x8",
                                      "name": "Text",
                                      "fill": "$text-hi",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "You work as one crew on one release branch. The lead owns the plan and the merge order; nobody merges without the lead's go.\n\nEvery change lands as a commit on the release branch with an imperative subject. Run `make verify` before you report back, and paste the tail of its output when it fails.\n\nReport with `runner msg post --to lead`: what changed, what you ran, what is still open. Ask the lead, not the human, when a detail is ambiguous.\n\nThe reviewer reads every diff before the lead merges it. A finding is fixed on the same branch, never waved through; say which commit fixes it when you report.\n\nRelease notes are written last, from the merged commits, in English with a collapsed 中文 block. Keep them short: one line per change.\n\nNobody tags, publishes or cuts a nightly. The human does that after the lead reports the release ready.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                                      "fontSize": 14,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    }
                                  ]
